@startuml
' Figure 8.5 - Sequence Diagram: AI Assistant
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam backgroundColor white

actor Investigator
participant "Route" as R
participant "AI Assistant" as A
database "Database" as DB
participant "LLM\n(NVIDIA NIM)" as LLM

Investigator -> R : question
activate R
R -> A : answer(question, user)
activate A

A -> A : 1. classify intent
A -> DB : 2. retrieve context\n(scoped to user's cases)
DB --> A : permitted records only
A -> A : 3. build prompt

A -> LLM : 4. call model
alt model responds
  LLM --> A : reply
else unavailable
  A -> A : use mock reply
end

A -> A : 5. validate response
A -> A : 6. check hallucinations

A --> R : reply + flags
deactivate A
R --> Investigator : answer (+ warning if flagged)
deactivate R
@enduml
